What the two network files are
------------------------------
``*_airport_paths.json`` is the cleaned vector network in the airport local affine
frame, produced from the OSM extract by ``scripts/clean_osm.py`` and
``scripts/build_paths.py``.  ``*_graph.json`` adds the topological adjacency, the
discrete transition matrix, the segment partition and the one-metre anchor points
used by the estimator, and is produced by ``scripts/build_graph.py``.

Trajectory data
---------------
The surveillance records of both airports are the property of the corresponding
airport operator and are **not** distributed with this repository.  What is
distributed is

    data/samples/    a small redacted subset, kept for format demonstration and for
                     smoke testing the estimator, with the operational metadata and
                     the operator identifiers removed

The subset is provided without warranty.  It is not a sample from which the accuracy
figures of the paper can be recomputed, because the paper evaluates the complete
archive of each airport.
